TZ = UTC0: mktime (localtime t) = t       2000 of 2000
TZ = UTC0: localtime t = Unix.gmtime t    2000 of 2000
parse_time, RFC 1123  Sun, 06 Nov 1994 08:49:37 GMT: returns 0 2000
parse_time, RFC 850   Sunday, 06-Nov-94 08:49:37 GMT: returns 0 2000
parse_time, asctime   Sun Nov  6 08:49:37 1994: returns 0 2000
